<title>JAPAN: Chukyo Bank - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Chukyo Bank - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Revenues	    28.11		vs	   33.39</p>
<p> Operating	    4.14		vs	    4.07</p>
<p> Current	    736    million    vs	    2.02</p>
<p> Net		  696    million    vs	    1.22</p>
<p> EPS		    5.03 yen	  vs	    8.81 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    138 million	  vs	 138 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  2.50 yen	  vs	    2.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Chukyo Bank Ltd is a Nagoya-based regional bank.</p>
